  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197159,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The effect is definitely real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1199059,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The effect is definitely real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201000,
    "dDurationMs": 14000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, so those bitter delinquent dyed hair and the buzz cut from high school—those two are my most radical hairstyles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't have any. Radical hairstyles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't want to try it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So like, the layered cut you mentioned earlier, and like, various other cuts, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1231000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even if they're not radical, did you try out several different styles?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was actually going to ask you about hairstyles that were trendy and that you tried copying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did try one, but I regret it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1249000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1251000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you know what a choppy bang is? Choppy bang?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1253000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1254000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's where you cut the bangs really short. Above the eyebrows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1261000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like little kids. That was trendy. Who started it? Mamamoo? Was it because of Wheein?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1270000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was a time when it was really in style, and I thought if I did it, I'd become cute too, so I tried it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1279000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then I don't know how I managed to go around like that, but now I'm like, why did I do that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1287000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I searched Mamamoo, Wheein, choppy bang and it comes right up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1291000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Looking at it this way, it doesn't look bad, does it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1298000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It looked good on her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1299000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I didn't know it was trendy, and I didn't know why it was trendy either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1307000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then I saw a lot of people doing this on the street."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1311000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I saw one or two people I know who did it too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like, why are they doing that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everyone probably thought the same thing, right? When they saw me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1324000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like trying to be cute, you know? It's not pretty, right? The hair?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a bit hard to understand, I'd say?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hard to understand, so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1333000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Why? Why? Like, why? Why? Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1338000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's cute though. Cuteness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1340000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cuteness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1341000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because this is a bit unique, I think that's why I tried it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1344000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, it is pretty unique."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1345000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And your impression changes a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1349000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this kind of thing, even if it fails, it seems to grow out quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1353000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1355000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, is that so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1357000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1358000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, is that so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1359000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1361000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, really?"
